hadiths[50]{hadithnumber,text}:
"959","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ke raaste mein jihad karne wale ki misaal hamesha roza rakhne wale hamesha qiyam karne wale ki si hai jo namaz aur roze se na thake yahan tak ke laute."
"960","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ne us ke liye zimma liya hai jo us ke raaste mein jihad kare, use apne ghar se us ke raaste mein jihad aur us ke kalimon ki tasdeeq ke siwa kuchh na nikale, ke use Jannat mein dakhil kare ya use us ke rehne ki jagah ki taraf lautae jahan se wo nikla tha, us ke sath jo us ne ajr ya ghanimat pai."
"961","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Abu Saleh Samman se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ghode aik mard ke liye ajr hain aur aik mard ke liye parda aur aik mard par bojh, phir jis ke liye wo ajr hain to wo mard hai jis ne use Allah ke raaste mein bandha aur us ke liye charagah ya sabzazar mein rassi lambi ki to jo us ne apni rassi ki muddat mein us charagah ya sabzazar mein se pai wo us ke liye nekiyan thin, aur agar us ne apni wo rassi kaat di aur aik ya do bulandi par sarakashi ki to us ke nishanat aur leed us ke liye nekiyan thin, aur agar wo neher par se guzre aur is mein se piye aur us ne use pilane ka irada na kya ho to ye us ke liye nekiyan thin, to wo us ke liye ajr hain, aur wo mard jis ne use beniyazi aur pakdamani ke liye bandha aur un ki gardanon aur un ki peethon mein Allah ka haq na bhula to wo is ke liye parda hain, aur wo mard jis ne use fakhr aur dikhawe aur ahl-e-Islam se dushmani ke liye bandha to wo is par bojh hain. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se gadhon ke bare mein pucha gaya to Aap ne farmaya ke mujh par is mein kuchh nazil na hua siwae is jami mani wali yagana aayat ke ke jo zarra barabar bhalai karega use dekhega aur jo zarra barabar burai karega use dekhega."
"962","Mujhe Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Mamar Ansari se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Ata se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya main tumhein logon mein se behtar thikane wale ki khabar na dun, wo mard jo apne ghode ki lagam pakde hue Allah ke raaste mein jihad karta hai, kya main tumhein us ke baad logon mein se behtar thikane wale ki khabar na dun, wo mard jo apni bakriyon mein alag rehta hai, namaz qaim karta hai aur zakat deta hai aur Allah ki ibadat karta hai, us ke sath koi cheez shareek na karta ho."
"963","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Ubada bin Waleed bin Ubada bin Samit ne, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se khabar di ke unhon ne kaha ke hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aasani aur tangi aur khushi aur nakhushi mein sunne aur itaat par baiat ki aur ke hum hukm walon se hukm na chheenein aur ke hum haq kahein ya haq par qaim hon jahan kahin hon, Allah ke bare mein malamat karne wale ki malamat se na darein."
"964","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Jarrah ke bete Abu Ubaida ne Umar bin Khattab ko likha jis mein unhon ne Romiyon ke jamav aur un se jis ka khauf tha zikr kya to Umar bin Khattab ne unhein likha ke amma baad, momin bande par sakhti ka jo thikana utre Allah us ke baad kushadgi karta hai, aur do aasaniyan aik tangi par kabhi ghalib na aaengi, aur Allah Taala apni kitab mein kehte hain ke aye iman walo sabr karo aur sabr mein badh jao aur morchon par jame raho aur Allah se daro taake tum kamyab ho."
"965","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dushman ki sarzameen ki taraf Quran lekar safar karne se mana kya."
"966","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Malik ke bete Kaab ke bete se riwayat kya, unhon ne kaha ke mera khayal hai ke unhon ne Kaab ke bete Abdur Rahman se kaha ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jinhein Haqiq ke bete Ibn Abi Haqiq ko qatal karne bheja tha unhein auraton aur bachon ko qatal karne se mana kya. Unhon ne kaha ke un mein se aik mard kehta tha ke Haqiq ke bete Ibn Abi Haqiq ki biwi ne cheekh se hamein bechain kar diya to main us par talwar uthata phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki mumaniat yaad karta to ruk jata, aur agar ye na hota to hum is se aaram pate."
"967","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Umar ke bete Ibn Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne baaz ghazwat mein aik maqtula aurat dekhi to is ka inkar kya aur auraton aur bachon ko qatal karne se mana kya."
"968","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Abu Bakr Siddiq ne Sham ki taraf lashkar bheje aur Sufyan ke bete Yazeed ke sath paidal nikle jabke wo un chaar hisson mein se aik hisse ke ameer they, to unhon ne kaha ke Yazeed ne Abu Bakr se kaha ke ya to aap sawaar hon ya main utrun. To Abu Bakr ne kaha ke na tum utroge aur na main sawaar hunga, main apne in qadmon ko Allah ke raaste mein shumar karta hun, phir un se kaha ke tum aisi qoum paoge jinhon ne kaha ke unhon ne apne aap ko Allah ke liye rok rakha hai to unhein chhor do aur jo unhon ne kaha ke unhon ne apne aap ko us ke liye rok rakha hai, aur tum aisi qoum paoge jinhon ne apne saron ke darmiyan se baal mundwae hain to jis se unhon ne mundwaya hai use talwar se maro, aur main tumhein das cheezon ki wasiyat karta hun, na aurat ko qatal karna aur na bache ko aur na budhe zaeef ko, aur na phaldar darakht katna aur na aabad ko ujadna, aur na bakri aur na oont ko zakhmi karna magar khane ke liye, aur na shehed ke chhatte ko jalana aur na use bikherna, aur na khayanat karna aur na buzdili karna."
"969","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne apne aamilon mein se aik aamil ko likha ke hamein khabar pahunchi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab sarriya bhejte to un se kehte ke Allah ke naam se Allah ke raaste mein jang karo, jo Allah ka inkar kare us se lado, na khayanat karo aur na dhoka do aur na musla karo aur na bache ko qatal karo, aur ye apne lashkaron aur sarriyaon se kaho insha Allah, wassalam alaik."
"970","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Kufa walon mein se aik mard se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne us lashkar ke aamil ko likha jo unhon ne bheja tha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke tum mein se kuchh mard ilj ko talash karte hain yahan tak ke jab wo pahad mein sahara le aur mana kare to aik shakhs kehta hai matras, yani kehta hai ke na daro, phir jab use pa le to use qatal kar de, aur main us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, main kisi ki jagah nahi janta jis ne aisa kya magar us ki gardan maarunga. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke ye hadis ijma wali nahi aur is par amal nahi. Aur Malik se aman ke ishare ke bare mein pucha gaya ke kya wo kalam ke manzilay mein hai, to unhon ne kaha ke haan, aur main samajhta hun ke lashkaron ko hukm diya jae ke jis ki taraf aman ka ishara karein use qatal na karein kyunke ishara mere nazdeek kalam ke manzilay mein hai, aur mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke Abdullah bin Abbas ne kaha ke jo qoum ahad se dhoka kare Allah un par dushman musallat kar deta hai."
"971","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo jab Allah ke raaste mein koi cheez dete to us ke malik se kehte ke jab Wadi-ul-Qura pahuncho to is se jo chaaho karo."
"972","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Saeed bin Musayyab kehte they ke jab mard ko jang mein cheez di jae aur wo is se apne ghazwe ki sarhad tak pahunche to wo us ke liye hai. Aur Malik se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jis ne apne upar jang wajib ki phir taiyari ki yahan tak ke jab nikalne laga to us ke maan baap ya in dono mein se aik ne use roka. To unhon ne kaha ke in dono se sakhti na kare lekin is ko agle saal tak moakhir kare, aur jahan tak saman ka talluq hai to meri rai hai ke use utha rakhe yahan tak ke is se nikle, phir agar dare ke kharab ho jaega to use beche aur us ki qeemat rok rakhe yahan tak ke is se wo khareede jo use jang ke liye durust kare, phir agar khushhaal ho aur apne saman jaisa pa sake jab nikle to apne saman se jo chahe kare."
"973","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Najd ki taraf sarriya bheja jis mein Abdullah bin Umar they to unhon ne bahut se oont ghanimat pae to un ke hisse barah oont ya gyarah oont they aur unhein aik aik oont nafal diya gaya."
"974","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab ko kehte suna ke log jang mein jab apni ghanimatein taqseem karte to oont ko das bakriyon ke barabar karte. Malik ne kaha ke jang mein mazdoor ke bare mein ke agar wo ladai mein hazir ho aur ladai ke waqt logon ke sath ho aur azaad ho to us ka hissa hai, aur agar aisa na kare to us ka hissa nahi, aur meri rai hai ke taqseem na ki jae magar us ke liye jo azaadon mein se ladai mein hazir ho."
"975","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Umar ka aik ghulam bhag gaya aur un ka aik gair mamooli ghoda tha to mushrikon ne in dono ko pa liya phir musalmanon ne in dono ko ghanimat paya to wo Abdullah bin Umar ko lautaye gae, aur ye is se pehle tha ke hisse in dono ko pahunchein."
"976","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Aflah ke bete Kaseer ke bete Umar se, unhon ne Qatada ke bete Abu Qatada ke azad karda Abu Muhammad se, unhon ne Rabi ke bete Abu Qatada se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Hunain ke saal nikle, phir jab hum mile to musalmanon ko shikast hui. Unhon ne kaha ke maine mushrikon mein se aik mard ko dekha jo musalmanon mein se aik mard par chadh gaya tha. Unhon ne kaha ke main us ke liye ghoom kar us ke peechhe se us ke paas aaya aur use kandhe ki nas par talwar mari to wo meri taraf mutawajjeh hua aur mujhe aise bhincha jis mein maine maut ki boo pai phir use maut ne pa liya aur us ne mujhe chhor diya. Unhon ne kaha ke main Umar bin Khattab se mila aur kaha ke logon ka kya haal hai. To unhon ne kaha ke Allah ka hukm hai. Phir log laute to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo maqtul qatal kare jis par us ke paas gawah ho to us ka saman us ke liye hai. Unhon ne kaha ke main khada hua phir kaha ke mere liye kaun gawahi dega phir baith gaya. Phir Aap ne farmaya ke jo maqtul qatal kare jis par us ke paas gawah ho to us ka saman us ke liye hai. Unhon ne kaha ke main khada hua phir kaha ke mere liye kaun gawahi dega phir baith gaya, phir Aap ne teesri martaba ye kaha to main khada hua. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aye Abu Qatada tumhein kya hai. Unhon ne kaha ke maine Aap se qissa bayan kya. To qoum mein se aik mard ne kaha ke us ne sach kaha ya Rasulullah, aur us maqtul ka saman mere paas hai to use meri taraf se razi karein ya Rasulullah. To Abu Bakr ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam nahi, tab wo Allah ke sheron mein se aik sher ki taraf jayega jo Allah aur us ke Rasool ki taraf se ladta hai aur tumhein us ka saman dega. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us ne sach kaha to use use do. To us ne mujhe use diya to maine zirah bechi aur is se Banu Salma mein khajoor ka bagh khareeda, aur ye sab se pehla maal hai jo maine Islam mein jama kya."
"977","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Qasim se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine aik mard ko Abdullah bin Abbas se anfal ke bare mein puchte suna to Ibn Abbas ne kaha ke ghoda nafal se hai aur saman nafal se hai. Unhon ne kaha ke phir wo mard apne sawal ki taraf lauta to Ibn Abbas ne ye bhi kaha, phir mard ne kaha ke wo anfal kya hain jo Allah ne apni kitab mein kahe. Qasim ne kaha ke wo un se puchhta raha yahan tak ke qareeb tha ke unhein tang kare, phir Ibn Abbas ne kaha ke kya tum jante ho ke is ki misaal kya hai, Sabigh ki misaal jise Umar bin Khattab ne mara tha. Unhon ne kaha ke Malik se us ke bare mein pucha gaya jo dushman mein se maqtul qatal kare ke kya us ka saman us ke liye hoga imam ki ijazat ke baghair. Unhon ne kaha ke ye kisi ke liye na hoga imam ki ijazat ke baghair, aur ye imam ki taraf se na hoga magar ijtihad ke taur par, aur mujhe khabar na pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo maqtul qatal kare us ka saman us ke liye hai magar Hunain ke din."
"978","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke logon ko nafal khums se diya jata tha. Malik ne kaha ke is bare mein jo maine suna yehi sab se behtar hai. Aur Malik se nafal ke bare mein pucha gaya ke kya wo pehli ghanimat mein hoga. Unhon ne kaha ke ye imam ke ijtihad ke taur par hai aur hamare nazdeek is mein koi maroof mamool nahi siwae hukmran ke ijtihad ke, aur mujhe khabar na pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne tamam ghazwat mein nafal diya, aur mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke Aap ne baaz mein nafal diya Hunain ke din, aur ye to pehli ghanimat aur is ke baad mein imam ke ijtihad ke taur par hai."
"979","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz kehte they ke ghode ke do hisse hain aur mard ka aik hissa hai. Malik ne kaha ke main hamesha se ye sunta aaya hun. Aur Malik se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jo bahut se ghodon ke sath hazir ho ke kya un sab ke liye taqseem kya jaega. To unhon ne kaha ke maine is ka na suna aur meri rai nahi ke taqseem kya jae magar aik ghode ke liye jis par wo ladta hai. Malik ne kaha ke main Barazin aur Hajin ko ghodon ke siwa nahi samajhta kyunke Allah Tabarak wa Taala apni kitab mein kehte hain ke aur ghode aur khachchar aur gadhe taake in par sawaar ho aur zeenat, aur Allah Azza wa Jal ne farmaya ke un ke liye jitni taqat ho sake taiyar karo aur ghodon ke bandhne se jis se Allah ke dushman aur apne dushman ko darao, to main Barazin aur Hajin ko ghodon mein se samajhta hun jab wali use jaiz kare, aur Saeed bin Musayyab ne kaha aur un se Barazin ke bare mein pucha gaya ke kya in mein se sadqa hai. To unhon ne kaha ke kya ghodon mein se sadqa hai."
"980","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Saeed ke bete Abd Rabbihi se, unhon ne Shoaib ke bete Amr se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Hunain se Jirana ka irada karke laute to logon ne Aap se manga yahan tak ke Aap ki oontni Aap ko darakht se qareeb le aayi aur us ne Aap ki chadar uljha di yahan tak ke use Aap ki peeth se kheench liya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri chadar mujhe lautao, kya tum darte ho ke main tumhare darmiyan wo taqseem na karunga jo Allah ne tum par fae kya, us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai agar Allah tum par Tihama ke kikaron jaisi bakriyan fae kare to main use tumhare darmiyan taqseem karunga phir tum mujhe bakheel aur na buzdil aur na jhoota paoge. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) utre to logon mein khade hue aur farmaya ke sui aur dhaga ada karo kyunke ghalul apne ghar walon par Qiyamat ke din aar aur aag aur badnami hai. Unhon ne kaha ke phir Aap ne zameen se oont ki oon ya koi cheez uthayi phir farmaya ke us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai jo Allah ne tum par fae kya is mein se mere liye is jaisi ke siwa kuchh nahi magar khums, aur khums tum par lautaya gaya hai."
"981","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Habban ke bete Muhammad bin Yahya se riwayat kya ke Juhani Khalid ke bete Zaid ne kaha ke Hunain ke din aik mard mar gaya aur unhon ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya to Zaid ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne sathi ki namaz padho. To logon ke chehre is se badal gae to Zaid ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhare sathi ne Allah ke raaste mein ghalul kya hai. Unhon ne kaha ke hum ne us ka saman khola to Yahud ke mankon mein se manke pae jo do dirham ke barabar bhi na they."
"982","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Burda ke bete Abi Burda ke bete Mughira ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon ke paas un ke qabeelon mein aae un ke liye dua karte hue aur Aap ne qabeelon mein se aik qabeela chhor diya. Unhon ne kaha ke qabeela ne un mein se aik mard ki katthi mein aqeeq ka haar ghalul paya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un ke paas aae aur un par takbeer kahi jaisa murde par takbeer kahi jati hai."
"983","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dili Saur bin Zaid se, unhon ne Abu Ghais se, unhon ne Muti ke bete Ibn Muti ke azad karda Salim se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Hunain ke saal nikle aur hum ne sona aur na chandi ghanimat pai magar maal kapde aur saman. Unhon ne kaha ke Zaid ke bete Rifa ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko siyah ghulam tohfe mein diya jise Midam kaha jata hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use Wadi-ul-Qura ki taraf bheja yahan tak ke jab hum Wadi-ul-Qura mein they jabke Midam Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka kajawa utar raha tha to achanak use gumrah teer aaya aur use laga aur use qatal kar diya to logon ne kaha ke use Jannat mubarak ho. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hargiz nahi, us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai wo chadar jo us ne Hunain ke din ghanimaton mein se li thi jinhein hisse na pahunche the use aag ki tarah bhadak rahi hai. Unhon ne kaha ke phir jab logon ne ye suna to aik mard aik ya do tasme lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aag ka aik ya do tasme hain."
"984","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhein Abdullah bin Abbas se khabar pahunchi ke unhon ne kaha ke jis qoum mein ghalul zahir ho us ke dilon mein rob dala jata hai, aur jis qoum mein zina phail jae us mein maut kasrat se hoti hai, aur jo qoum naap tol mein kami kare us se rizq kaat liya jata hai, aur jo qoum na-haq faisla kare us mein khoon phail jata hai, aur jo qoum ahad se dhoka kare Allah un par dushman musallat kar deta hai."
"985","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai main chahta hun ke Allah ke raaste mein ladun phir qatal kya jaun phir zinda hun phir qatal kya jaun phir zinda hun phir qatal kya jaun. To Abu Huraira kehte they teen martaba, Allah ki qasam khata hun."
"986","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah do mardon par hansta hai jin mein se aik dusre ko qatal karta hai jabke dono Jannat mein dakhil honge, ye Allah ke raaste mein ladta hai aur qatal kya jata hai phir Allah qatil par tauba karta hai aur wo ladta hai aur shaheed hota hai."
"987","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai koi Allah ke raaste mein zakhmi nahi hota, aur Allah khoob janta hai ke kaun us ke raaste mein zakhmi hota hai, magar Qiyamat ke din aaega jabke us ka zakhm khoon behta hoga, rang khoon ka rang aur khushbu mushk ki khushbu."
"988","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab kehte they ke aye Allah meri qatl aise mard ke haath se na kar jo tere liye aik sajda namaz padhta ho jis se wo mere khilaf tere paas Qiyamat ke din hujjat kare."
"989","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Maqbari Saeed ke bete Saeed bin Abi Saeed se, unhon ne Qatada ke bete Abdullah bin Abi Qatada se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke aik mard Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah agar main Allah ke raaste mein qatal kya jaun sabr karne wala sawab chahne wala aage badhne wala peeth na pherne wala to kya Allah meri khatayein mita dega. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan. Phir jab wo mard peeth pher kar gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use pukara ya use hukm diya aur use pukara gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke tum ne kya kaha. To us ne Aap se apna qaul dobara kaha to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke haan magar qarz, isi tarah Jibreel ne mujh se kaha."
"990","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ubaidullah ke bete Umar ke azad karda Abu Nadr se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Uhud ke shuhada se farmaya ke ye hain jin par main gawah hun. To Abu Bakr Siddiq ne kaha ke kya hum ya Rasulullah un ke bhai nahi, hum ne Islam qubool kya jaisa unhon ne Islam qubool kya aur hum ne jihad kya jaisa unhon ne jihad kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kyun nahi lekin main nahi janta ke tum mere baad kya naya karoge. To Abu Bakr roe phir roe phir kaha ke kya hum aap ke baad rehne walon mein se honge."
"991","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithe they aur Madina mein qabr khodi ja rahi thi to aik mard ne qabr mein jhanka aur kaha ke momin ka sone ka bura thikana hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum ne buri baat kahi. To mard ne kaha ke maine ye irada na kya tha ya Rasulullah, maine to Allah ke raaste mein qatl ka irada kya tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ke raaste mein qatl jaisa kuchh nahi, zameen par koi jagah nahi jo mujhe is se zyada pasand ho ke meri qabr us mein ho, teen martaba, yani Madina."
"992","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab kehte they ke aye Allah main tujh se tere raaste mein shahadat aur tere Rasool ke shehar mein wafat mangta hun."
"993","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke momin ki izzat us ka taqwa hai aur us ka deen us ka hasab hai aur us ki murawwat us ka akhlaq hai, aur dileri aur buzdili fitratein hain jinhein Allah jahan chahta hai rakhta hai, to buzdil apne maan baap se bhagta hai aur daler us par ladta hai jo us ke rehla ki taraf na laute, aur qatl mauton mein se aik maut hai aur shaheed wo hai jo apne aap ko Allah par shumar kare."
"994","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Makka se aae yahan tak ke jab Qudaid mein they to un ke paas Madina se khabar aayi to wo laute aur Makka mein baghair ehram ke dakhil hue. Aur mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se is jaisa riwayat kya."
"995","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab aik saal mein chalis hazaar oonton par sawari dete they, mard ko Sham ki taraf oont par sawari dete aur do mardon ko Iraq ki taraf oont par sawari dete, to un ke paas Iraq walon mein se aik mard aaya aur kaha ke mujhe aur Suhaim ko sawari dein. To Umar bin Khattab ne us se kaha ke main tumhein Allah ki qasam deta hun, kya Suhaim mashkiza hai. To us ne un se kaha ke haan."
"996","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Talha ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ishaq se, unhon ne Malik ke bete Anas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Quba ki taraf jate to Malhan ki beti Umm Haram ke paas dakhil hote aur wo Aap ko khilatin, aur Umm Haram Samit ke bete Ubada ke nikah mein thin, to aik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un ke paas dakhil hue aur unhon ne Aap ko khilaya aur wo Aap ke sar mein juen dekhne baithin to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gae."
"997","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Abu Saleh Samman se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar main apni ummat par mashaqqat na karta to pasand karta ke us sarriya se peechhe na rahun jo Allah ke raaste mein nikle, lekin main wo nahi pata jis par inhein sawari dun aur na wo pate hain jis par sawari karein aur wo niklein aur un par giran guzre ke mere peechhe peechhe rahein, to maine chaha ke Allah ke raaste mein ladun phir qatal kya jaun phir zinda hun phir qatal kya jaun phir zinda hun phir qatal kya jaun."
"998","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jab Uhud ka din tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaun mujhe Ansari Rabi ke bete Saad ki khabar laega. To aik mard ne kaha ke main ya Rasulullah. To wo mard maqtulon ke darmiyan phirne gaya to Rabi ke bete Saad ne us se kaha ke tumhara kya haal hai. To mard ne us se kaha ke mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aap ke paas bheja hai taake main Aap tak aap ki khabar pahunchaun. Unhon ne kaha ke Aap ke paas jao aur meri taraf se salam pahunchao aur unhein khabar do ke mujhe barah zakhm lage hain aur main apne maqtalon se nafiz ho chuka hun, aur apni qoum ko khabar do ke un ke liye Allah ke paas koi uzr nahi agar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qatal kiye jaein jabke un mein se aik zinda ho."
"999","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jihad ki targheeb di aur Jannat ka zikr kya jabke Ansar mein se aik mard apne haath mein khajoorein kha raha tha to us ne kaha ke main duniya par hirs karne wala hun agar baitha rahun yahan tak ke in se farigh hun. To jo us ke haath mein tha phenk diya aur apni talwar se hamla kya aur lada yahan tak ke qatal ho gaya."
"1000","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Jabal ke bete Muaz se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke ghazwe do hain, to wo ghazwa jis mein qeemti kharch ki jae aur shareek se narmi ki jae aur hukm wale ki itaat ki jae aur fasad se bacha jae to wo ghazwa tamam bhalai hai, aur wo ghazwa jis mein qeemti kharch na ki jae aur na shareek se narmi ki jae aur na hukm wale ki itaat ki jae aur na fasad se bacha jae to wo ghazwa hai ke us ka karne wala barabar na laute."
"1001","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ghodon ki peshaniyon mein Qiyamat ke din tak bhalai hai."
"1002","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un ghodon ke darmiyan muqabla karaya jo taiyar kiye gae they Hafya se aur un ki had Wida ki ghati thi, aur un ghodon ke darmiyan muqabla karaya jo taiyar na kiye gae they ghati se Zuraiq ke Banu ki masjid tak, aur Abdullah bin Umar un mein se they jo is se muqabla karte they."
"1003","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab ko kehte suna ke ghodon ki shart mein koi harj nahi jab is mein muhallil dakhil ho, phir agar wo aage badhe to inaam le aur agar peechhe rahe to us par kuchh nahi."
"1004","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha gaya jabke Aap apne ghode ka chehra apni chadar se ponchh rahe they to Aap se is ke bare mein pucha gaya to Aap ne farmaya ke mujhe raat mein ghodon ke bare mein malamat ki gayi."
"1005","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Humaid Taweel se, unhon ne Malik ke bete Anas se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Khaibar ki taraf nikle to raat mein us ke paas aae, aur jab raat mein kisi qoum ke paas aate to subah tak hamla na karte, to Yahud apne phavdon aur tokriyon ke sath nikle, phir jab unhon ne Aap ko dekha to kaha ke Allah ki qasam Muhammad hain, Muhammad aur lashkar hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah sab se bada hai, Khaibar ujad gayi, jab hum kisi qoum ke sehan mein utrein to darae gaon ki subah buri hogi."
"1006","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Humaid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo Allah ke raaste mein do jode kharch kare use Jannat mein pukara jaega ke aye Allah ke bande ye bhalai hai, to jo namaz walon mein se ho use namaz ke darwaze se pukara jaega, aur jo jihad walon mein se ho use jihad ke darwaze se pukara jaega, aur jo sadqa walon mein se ho use sadqe ke darwaze se pukara jaega, aur jo roze walon mein se ho use Rayyan ke darwaze se pukara jaega. To Abu Bakr Siddiq ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah jo in darwazon se pukara jae us par koi zarurat nahi, to kya koi in tamam darwazon se pukara jaega. Aap ne farmaya ke haan aur main umeed karta hun ke tum un mein se hoge."
"1007","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abi Sasa ke bete Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Jamuh ke bete Amr aur Ansari Abdullah bin Amr phir Sulami, sailab ne in dono ki qabr khod di thi jabke in dono ki qabr sailab ke pehlu mein thi aur wo dono aik qabr mein they aur wo dono un mein se they jo Uhud ke din shaheed hue, to in dono ko jagah se badalne ke liye khoda gaya to wo dono aise pae gae ke badle na they goya wo kal mare they, aur in dono mein se aik zakhmi hua tha to us ne apna haath apne zakhm par rakha tha aur use is tarah dafan kya gaya tha, to us ka haath us ke zakhm se hataya gaya phir chhora gaya to waisa hi laut aaya jaisa tha, aur Uhud aur in dono par khodne ke din ke darmiyan chhiyalis saal they. Malik ne kaha ke zarurat se do ya teen mardon ko aik qabr mein dafan karne mein koi harj nahi aur bade ko Qibla ke pehlu mein kare."
"1008","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Rabia se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Bahrain se Abu Bakr Siddiq ke paas maal aaya to unhon ne kaha ke jis ka Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas wada ya ehed ho wo mere paas aae, to un ke paas Abdullah ke bete Jabir aae to unhon ne un ke liye teen lap bhar kar diye."
